# Documentation rules

## Canonical documents

| Document | Role |
|----------|------|
| [`docs/NEXT_PRODUCT_FEATURES.md`](docs/NEXT_PRODUCT_FEATURES.md) | Master product roadmap |
| [`docs/API_INVENTORY.md`](docs/API_INVENTORY.md) | Existing API inventory |
| [`docs/API_TESTING_GUIDE.md`](docs/API_TESTING_GUIDE.md) | API setup / testing guidance |
| [`docs/openapi.yaml`](docs/openapi.yaml) | API reference |

## Rules

- Keep documentation aligned with actual implementation.
- Do not invent APIs or database behavior.
- Update API documentation when approved API changes are made.
- Do not duplicate the master roadmap into other documents.
- Keep implementation plans separate from permanent product documentation.
- Clearly identify **proposed** functionality versus **implemented** functionality.
